  ⚠ svelte(require-each-key): Each block should have a key.
   ╭─[require_each_key.tsx:1:1]
 1 │ {#each items as item}<Row {item} />{/each}
   · ─────────────────────
   ╰────
  help: Add a keyed expression, e.g. `{#each items as item (item.id)}`, so Svelte can track each item's identity when the list changes.

  ⚠ svelte(require-each-key): Each block should have a key.
   ╭─[require_each_key.tsx:1:1]
 1 │ {#each new Array(3)}<hr>{/each}
   · ────────────────────
   ╰────
  help: Add a keyed expression, e.g. `{#each items as item (item.id)}`, so Svelte can track each item's identity when the list changes.

  ⚠ svelte(require-each-key): Each block should have a key.
   ╭─[require_each_key.tsx:1:29]
 1 │ {#each rows as row (row.id)}{#each row.cells as cell}<td>{cell}</td>{/each}{/each}
   ·                             ─────────────────────────
